Beast 3.0 Healthcare & Wellness Division
The Healthcare & Wellness Division serves as the health services coordination authority for the Beast 3.0 framework.

Mission
Promote physical, mental, emotional, and social wellbeing through resource coordination, education, advocacy, and access to health services.

Core Responsibilities
Healthcare Navigation
Wellness Programs
Mental Health Resources
Preventive Care
Benefits Coordination
Health Education
Community Wellbeing
Strategic Objectives
Improve Health Access
Increase Wellness Engagement
Support Mental Health
Reduce Healthcare Barriers
Promote Healthy Communities
Status
Development
